msgid "\n"
"        Makes a user or role immune from automated moderation actions.\n\n"
"        **Examples:**\n"
"        - `[p]autoimmune add @Twentysix` - Adds a user.\n"
"        - `[p]autoimmune add @Mods` - Adds a role.\n\n"
"        **Arguments:**\n"
"        - `<user_or_role>` - The user or role to add immunity to.\n"
